  "notes": [
    "The number comes first: बारह नंबर (\"twelve number\") is bus number twelve.",
    "On many city buses in India you pay the conductor (कंडक्टर), who walks through the bus selling tickets.",
    "मिलना means \"to be found, to be available\": टिकट कहाँ मिलेगा? is \"where will I get a ticket?\".",
    "किराया is the fare. For an auto-rickshaw, agree the किराया before you get in, or ask for the meter."
